## Product: CompeteAI 🧠

**Tagline:** *"Know your market before you make your content."*

### What It Does (User Flow)

```
User pastes: Amazon Best Sellers URL OR any Amazon product search
     ↓
CompeteAI scrapes top 10 competitor listings + 100+ reviews each
     ↓
AI analyzes: Purchase criteria, pain points, what customers love/hate
     ↓
Output Dashboard:
  ✅ Market Size (estimated monthly revenue of entire market)
  ✅ Top 10 competitors with individual revenue estimates
  ✅ Key Purchase Criteria ranked by frequency
  ✅ Sentiment Heatmap (what reviewers love vs. hate)
  ✅ Content Strategy Recommendations ("focus on durability in your copy")
  ✅ Opportunity gaps (what no competitor is doing well)
```

